  "body": "**IMPORTANT: Please disregard the previous 2021 sale price - it is not a reflection of the owners' current expectations.**\r\n\r\nThe owners are highly motivated and ready to move closer to the city. They cannot make their next move until this property is sold, so they're ready to consider genuine offers.\r\n\r\nOffering five bedrooms, three living spaces, three bathrooms, four toilets, great granny-flat-style potential, a sunny north-facing garden, deck, internal-access garage and three off-street parks.\r\n\r\nOPEN TO ALL OFFERS - FLEXIBLE ON TERMS AND SETTLEMENT.\r\n\r\nDon't assume this home is out of reach. If you're interested, get in touch and put an offer forward.\r\n\r\nConjunctionals warmly welcomed.\r\n\r\nTeam Lisa Westerby & Montana Northcroft - Selling over $200mil+ of real estate across 35 Auckland suburbs.",
